  "accelerationFactor_note": "Cold-start fallback only — tick.js mirrors the LIVE multiplier here on every regime change. MEASURED 2026-07-22 16:30 CDT: acceleration ended at 15:42 CDT as a cliff to x1. The expected x2 tier never appeared in auth-data (it still shows the expired x3 entry) and new orders price at x1 (orange retail order 147.8/h = store L2 base x weather, no accel). Verified mechanic: in-flight orders KEEP their placement-time multiplier — the 15:13 CDT grape order ran at x3 (~980/h observed) for 4.2h past the expiry.",
