  "_minCash_note": "Raised 500 -> 5000 by board 2026-07-22 R3 (unanimous): one normal water buy ($4.6k) plus same-hour production charges ($3.0k) exceed the old floor 15x. This is the working-capital floor for DISCRETIONARY spend (input buys, order wages). buildPlan.minCashAfter deliberately stays 500 so the Mill build gate is never delayed by this policy (owner earmark 2026-07-22 supersedes).",
