    "_why": "Coffee chain: one farm on beans (499/h with the +21% event modifier) exactly feeds one Mill (needs 404/h) at 40.4 powder/h. Profit $25.05/unit vs $1.66 for an apple — $1,013/h against $265/h once the x3 acceleration expires, using the SAME farm and store.",
